{"abstract":"To compare a computer-assisted home exercise program with conservative home-training following printed instructions in the rehabilitation of elderly patients with vestibular dysfunction. Both groups improved significantly during 16 weeks of rehabilitation. However, neither t tests nor repeated-measures analysis of variance demonstrated any significant differences between the 2 groups. The overall compliance rate to computer program exercises during 16 weeks was 57%. A computer-assisted program to support the home training of elderly patients with vestibular dysfunction did not improve rehabilitation more than did printed instructions.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Smaerup, Michael","Grönvall, Erik","Larsen, Simon B.","Læssøe, Uffe","Henriksen, Jens-Jacob","Damsgaard, Else Marie"],"cuid":["S03-086.71-010396"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corresponding_author":["Brandt, Michael Smærup"],"keyword":["Computer Assisted","Patient Compliance","Rehabilitation","Therapy","Therapy Computer Assisted","Vestibular diseases"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-ALX"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-ALX","DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"computer assisted training as a complement in rehabilitation of patients with chronic vestibular dizziness a randomized controlled trial","src":["aau","au","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apmr.2014.10.005","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S03-086.71-010396","identifier":[{"id":"25450134","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84924094946","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:00035