{"abstract":"In this paper we discuss some of the challenges and opportunities for the implementation of self-monitoring technologies in senior adults everyday lives. We present our experiences from a self-monitoring case study. We further describe our design process as part of the ongoing Lev Vel Project, a cross-disciplinary Danish initiative for increasing participation in citizen's own care management","author_count":4,"contributors":["Verdezoto, Nervo","Grönvall, Erik","Vincentz, Sofie","Rostgaard Thielsen, Svend"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-185571"],"event":{"end":"2012-05-05","place":"Austin, Texas, us","start":"2012-05-05","title":"Bridging Clinical and Non-clinical Health Practices: Opportunities and Challenges","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-ALX"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-ALX","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"exploring challenges of self monitoring for senior adults","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/45567745/Verdezoto.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-185571","ids":["au-62820c03-44f1-4a27-a64c-3e00949bed60"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3342972C15F574CD41B797263E4316E6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/45567745/Verdezoto.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.ics.uci.edu/~yunanc/chi2012health/Downloads/Verdezoto.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"alexandra institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-ALX","l3nn":"Alexandra Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Alexandra Institute","namevar":["Alexandra Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-ALX","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nervo","key":"verdezotopau","last":"Verdezoto","locid":"ce629209-5619-4b43-88fb-b8fd03725adb","name":"Verdezoto, Nervo","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Erik","key":"grönvallpau","last":"Grönvall","locid":"b600b501-1612-47fd-9286-f687efaefaf0","name":"Grönvall, Erik","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Sofie","key":"vincentzpau","last":"Vincentz","name":"Vincentz, Sofie","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Svend","key":"rostgaardthielsenpau","last":"Rostgaard Thielsen","name":"Rostgaard Thielsen, Svend","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-62820c03-44f1-4a27-a64c-3e00949bed60"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Exploring Challenges of Self-Monitoring for Senior Adults","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-185571","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Sustaining daily, unsupervised healthcare activities in a private home setting can challenge, among others, older adults. In this paper, we discuss experiences from designing a tablet mobile application, MediFrame, to support older adults’ medication management at home. In relation to MediFrame’s touch interface design, we discuss existing guidelines that can be adopted for touch interfaces and we use MediFrame to illustrate an implementation of such guidelines.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Verdezoto, Nervo","Grönvall, Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-200373"],"event":{"end":"2012-10-14","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2012-10-14","title":"How to Design Touch Interfaces for and with Older Adults: Identification of Challenges and Opportunities","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Mobile","Older adults","Participatory Design","Tablet"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"designing a tablet touch screen interface for older adults","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://workshops.icts.sbg.ac.at/NordiCHI2012/papers/Verdezoto_et_al.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-200373","ids":["au-7c22a3d3-630e-43ac-8b5c-feb6b3101b17"],"keyword":["Mobile","Older Adults","Participatory Design","Tablet","Touch Interfaces"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3D0A3CA4CDE2DAC607B3033C55556C7D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://workshops.icts.sbg.ac.at/NordiCHI2012/papers/Verdezoto_et_al.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nervo","key":"verdezotopau","last":"Verdezoto","locid":"ce629209-5619-4b43-88fb-b8fd03725adb","name":"Verdezoto, Nervo","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Erik","key":"grönvallpau","last":"Grönvall","locid":"b600b501-1612-47fd-9286-f687efaefaf0","name":"Grönvall, Erik","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-7c22a3d3-630e-43ac-8b5c-feb6b3101b17"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Designing a Tablet Touch-Screen Interface for Older Adults","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-200373","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"This paper depicts findings from a project focusing on designing medicine management support for nonclinical settings. In particular, we discuss how we can support older adults across boundaries of care in planning, informing, reminding and documenting activities. Additionally, we present opportunities when designing for everyday medication management. We use MediFrame, a tablet based app that supports older adults in their medicine intake at home and findings from its Participatory Design process to support our argumentation.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Verdezoto, Nervo","Grönvall, Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-152779"],"event":{"end":"2012-10-14","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2012-10-14","title":"Designing for Self-Care Acknowledging the Home-Clinic Difference","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Healthcare information systems","Medication Adherence","Older people","Self Care","home based technology"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"opportunities to support medication intake across boundaries of care","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/49127637/verdezoto_gronvall_rehab2012_ws_final_version.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-152779","ids":["au-28db56d5-7066-408e-a659-7147d37873c6"],"keyword":["Medication Adherence","Older people","Self-care","healthcare information systems","home-based technology"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-846F18CFC55A72DAF9DC73D8928F9411"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://users-cs.au.dk/gronvall/nordichi_rehab2012/accepted.html","version":"Ot